flowchart TB
  A[DETECTED] --> B[TRIAGED] --> C[POLICY CHECK] --> D[SAFETY CHECK: allowlist, preconditions]
  D -->|condition cleared| SK[SKIPPED - nothing to do]
  D --> E[BACKUP] --> F[EXECUTION]
  F -->|validation failed| RB[ROLLBACK]
  F --> G{VERIFICATION of the real end state}
  G -->|pass| H[COMMIT] --> I[CHATOPS: AUTOHEAL EVENT] --> J[AUDIT]
  G -->|fail| RB --> K{Original state verified?}
  K -->|yes| L[ROLLED_BACK - human required] --> I2[CHATOPS: AUTOHEAL FAILED] --> J
  K -->|no| M[ROLLBACK FAILED - page on-call] --> J
